msgid "Change Terminal Title"
msgstr "變更終端機標題"

msgid "Leave blank to restore the default title."
msgstr "留空即可還原為預設標題。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "確定"

msgid "Configuration Errors"
msgstr "設定錯誤"

msgid ""
"One or more configuration errors were found. Please review the errors below, "
"and either reload your configuration or ignore these errors."
msgstr ""
"發現有設定錯誤。請檢視以下錯誤，並重新載入設定或忽略這些錯誤。"

msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "忽略"

msgid "Reload Configuration"
msgstr "重新載入設定"

msgid "Split Up"
msgstr "向上分割"

msgid "Split Down"
msgstr "向下分割"

msgid "Split Left"
msgstr "向左分割"

msgid "Split Right"
msgstr "向右分割"

msgid "Execute a command…"
msgstr "執行命令…"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "複製"

msgid "Paste"
msgstr "貼上"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "清除"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重設"

msgid "Split"
msgstr "分割"

msgid "Change Title…"
msgstr "變更標題…"

msgid "Tab"
msgstr "分頁"

msgid "New Tab"
msgstr "開新分頁"

msgid "Close Tab"
msgstr "關閉分頁"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "視窗"

msgid "New Window"
msgstr "開新視窗"

msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "關閉視窗"

msgid "Config"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "Open Configuration"
msgstr "開啟設定"

msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "命令面板"

msgid "Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "終端機檢查工具"

msgid "About Witty"
msgstr "關於 Witty"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "結束"

msgid "Authorize Clipboard Access"
msgstr "授權存取剪貼簿"

msgid ""
"An application is attempting to read from the clipboard. The current "
"clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr ""
"有應用程式正嘗試讀取剪貼簿，目前的剪貼簿內容顯示如下。"

msgid "Deny"
msgstr "拒絕"

msgid "Allow"
msgstr "允許"

msgid "Remember choice for this split"
msgstr "記住此窗格的選擇"

msgid "Reload configuration to show this prompt again"
msgstr "重新載入設定以再次顯示此提示"

msgid ""
"An application is attempting to write to the clipboard. The current "
"clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr ""
"有應用程式正嘗試寫入剪貼簿，目前的剪貼簿內容顯示如下。"

msgid "Warning: Potentially Unsafe Paste"
msgstr "警告：可能有潛在安全風險的貼上操作"

msgid ""
"Pasting this text into the terminal may be dangerous as it looks like some "
"commands may be executed."
msgstr ""
"將這段文字貼到終端機具有潛在風險，因為它看起來像是可能會被執行的命令。"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

msgid "Quit Witty?"
msgstr "要結束 Witty 嗎？"

msgid "Close Window?"
msgstr "是否要關閉視窗？"

msgid "Close Tab?"
msgstr "是否要關閉分頁？"

msgid "Close Split?"
msgstr "是否要關閉窗格？"

msgid "All terminal sessions will be terminated."
msgstr "所有終端機工作階段都將被終止。"

msgid "All terminal sessions in this window will be terminated."
msgstr "此視窗中的所有終端機工作階段都將被終止。"

msgid "All terminal sessions in this tab will be terminated."
msgstr "此分頁中的所有終端機工作階段都將被終止。"

msgid "The currently running process in this split will be terminated."
msgstr "此窗格中目前執行的處理程序將被終止。"

msgid "Copied to clipboard"
msgstr "已複製到剪貼簿"

msgid "Cleared clipboard"
msgstr "已清除剪貼簿"

msgid "Command Succeeded"
msgstr "命令執行成功"

msgid "Command Failed"
msgstr "命令執行失敗"

msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "主選單"

msgid "View Open Tabs"
msgstr "檢視已開啟的分頁"

msgid "New Split"
msgstr "新增窗格"

msgid ""
"⚠️ You're running a debug build of Witty! Performance will be degraded."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ 您正在執行 Witty 的除錯版本！程式運作效能將會受到影響。"

msgid "Reloaded the configuration"
msgstr "已重新載入設定"

msgid "Witty Developers"
msgstr "Witty 開發者"

msgid "Witty: Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "Witty：終端機檢查工具"
